      </td>
     <td><para unique="1045921">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1045923">FMA</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1045925">Multiply packed double precision floating-point values from xmm1 and xmm2, negate the multiplication result and add to xmm3/mem and put result in xmm1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1045927">VEX.128.66.0F38.W1 BC /r </para>
